---
import { Code } from 'astro:components';
import { readFileSync } from 'node:fs';
import { resolve } from 'node:path';
import { loadExamples } from '../lib/examples.mjs';
import { dgmLanguage } from '../lib/dgm-language.mjs';
import { url } from '../lib/site';
import WindowControls from './WindowControls.astro';
import '../styles/terminal.css';
import '../styles/examples.css';
const examples = loadExamples().map(example => {
  const { id } = example;
  // Reserve the generated preview's actual aspect ratio before it loads.
  const preview = readFileSync(resolve('public/diagrams', `${id}-preview.svg`), 'utf8');
  const dimensions = preview.match(/<svg\b[^>]*\bwidth="(\d+)"[^>]*\bheight="(\d+)"/);
  if (!dimensions) throw new Error(`Missing preview dimensions: ${id}`);
  return { ...example, previewWidth: Number(dimensions[1]), previewHeight: Number(dimensions[2]) };
});
---
<section class="examples section" aria-labelledby="examples-title">
  <div class="section-heading examples-heading" id="how-it-works"><div><span class="eyebrow">01 / FROM REQUEST TO DIAGRAM</span><h2 id="examples-title">Describe the system.<br /><span class="muted">See how it becomes a diagram.</span></h2></div><p>Write a normal technical request. The agent interprets the architecture, produces reviewable .dgm code, and Dumb Diagrams renders the result.</p></div>
  <div class="example-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Example diagram" data-tabs>
    {examples.map((example, index) => <button id={`tab-${example.id}`} type="button" role="tab" aria-selected={index === 0 ? 'true' : 'false'} aria-controls={`example-${example.id}`} tabindex={index === 0 ? 0 : -1}><span class="mono">0{index + 1}</span>{example.title}</button>)}
  </div>
  <div class="example-panels">
  {examples.map((example, index) => <div id={`example-${example.id}`} role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby={`tab-${example.id}`} hidden={index !== 0} inert={index !== 0} class="example-panel">
    <div class="example-description"><p>{example.description}</p><span class="mono">HUMAN PROMPT <span aria-hidden="true">→</span> ENGINE INTERPRETATION <span aria-hidden="true">→</span> .DGM CODE <span aria-hidden="true">→</span> RESULT</span></div>
    <div class="example-workspace">
      <div class="example-input">
        <div class="input-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label={`${example.title} input`} data-tabs>
          <button id={`prompt-tab-${example.id}`} type="button" role="tab" data-mode="prompt" aria-selected="true" aria-controls={`prompt-${example.id}`} tabindex="0">Prompt</button>
          <button id={`interpretation-tab-${example.id}`} type="button" role="tab" data-mode="interpretation" aria-selected="false" aria-controls={`interpretation-${example.id}`} tabindex="-1">Engine interpretation</button>
          <button id={`source-tab-${example.id}`} type="button" role="tab" data-mode="source" aria-selected="false" aria-controls={`source-${example.id}`} tabindex="-1">.dgm code</button>
          <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
        </div>
        <div id={`prompt-${example.id}`} role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby={`prompt-tab-${example.id}`} class="prompt-pane">
          <div class="input-caption"><span>TRY THIS WITH YOUR AGENT</span><button type="button" data-copy-target={`prompt-text-${example.id}`} aria-label={`Copy ${example.title} prompt`}>Copy ⧉</button></div>
          <pre id={`prompt-text-${example.id}`} class="prompt-text" tabindex="0" aria-label={`${example.title} natural prompt`}>{example.prompt}</pre>
          <div class="input-footer"><span>NATURAL PROMPT</span><a href={url(`diagrams/${example.id}-prompt.txt`)} download>Save prompt ↓</a></div>
        </div>
        <div id={`interpretation-${example.id}`} role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby={`interpretation-tab-${example.id}`} class="interpretation-pane" hidden>
          <div class="input-caption"><span>ENGINE INTERPRETATION</span><button type="button" data-copy-target={`interpretation-text-${example.id}`} aria-label={`Copy ${example.title} interpretation`}>Copy ⧉</button></div>
          <pre id={`interpretation-text-${example.id}`} class="prompt-text interpretation-text" tabindex="0" aria-label={`${example.title} architecture interpretation`}>{example.interpretation}</pre>
          <div class="input-footer"><span>ARCHITECTURE BRIEF</span></div>
        </div>
        <div id={`source-${example.id}`} role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby={`source-tab-${example.id}`} class="source-pane" hidden>
          <div class="mac-titlebar"><WindowControls /><span class="mac-window-title">{example.id}.dgm</span><button class="source-copy" type="button" data-copy-target={`source-text-${example.id}`} aria-label={`Copy ${example.title} source`}>Copy ⧉</button></div>
          <div id={`source-text-${example.id}`} class="source-code" tabindex="0" aria-label={`${example.title} generated source`}><Code code={example.source.trimEnd()} lang={dgmLanguage} theme="github-dark" /></div>
          <div class="input-footer"><span>REVIEWABLE SOURCE</span><a href={url(`diagrams/${example.id}.dgm`)} download>Save .dgm ↓</a><a href={url(`diagrams/${example.id}.requirements.json`)} download>Save requirements ↓</a></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="example-output" data-diagram-preview data-initial-zoom="1">
        <div class="output-bar"><span class="mono">RESULT</span><div class="preview-controls" aria-label={`${example.title} preview controls`}><button type="button" data-zoom="out" aria-label={`Zoom out ${example.title}`}>−</button><button type="button" data-zoom="fit" aria-label={`Fit ${example.title} to preview`}>100%</button><button type="button" data-zoom="in" aria-label={`Zoom in ${example.title}`}>+</button></div><a href={url(`diagrams/${example.id}-preview.svg`)} target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label={`Open ${example.title} full size`}>Full size ↗</a></div>
        <div class="diagram-viewport" tabindex="0" aria-label={`${example.title} diagram; scroll to pan when zoomed`}><img src={url(`diagrams/${example.id}-preview.svg`)} alt={example.description} width={example.previewWidth} height={example.previewHeight} loading={index === 0 ? 'eager' : 'lazy'} /></div>
        <div class="output-footer"><span>Rendered from the Studio source.</span><a href={url(`diagrams/${example.id}.svg`)} download>Download SVG ↓</a></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>)}
  </div>
  <div class="examples-footnote"><span>Turn a plain-English request into a clear, reviewable diagram. Follow the architecture brief, inspect the final <code>.dgm</code> source, then open it in Studio to refine and ship it.</span><a href={url('docs/agent-workflow/')}>Create one with an agent ↗</a><a href={url('docs/aws-cross-account-data-transfer/')}>AWS cross-account tutorial ↗</a></div>
</section>
